The 25.12.19 swift/BUILD.bazel glob misses Sources/FlatBuffers/Vectors/
(FlatbuffersVectorInitializable et al live there), so the FlatBuffers
module doesn't compile; upstream master already includes it. Drop this
patch when bumping past a release that contains the fix.
--- a/swift/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/swift/BUILD.bazel
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@ swift_library(
     name = "swift",
     srcs = glob([
         "Sources/FlatBuffers/*.swift",
+        "Sources/FlatBuffers/Vectors/*.swift",
         "Sources/Common/*.swift",
     ]),
     module_name = "FlatBuffers",
